  "changes": [
    "The shared stored own-final reporter invokes the existing product native_accepted/native_rejection_reasons predicates only when all four recorded implementation source hashes match the loaded repository modules, with a second source-hash check after evaluation. The predicate implementation is reused rather than copied.",
